WEBVTT

00:06.397 --> 00:10.697
I have found hope 
in Emperor Ögedei and yourself.

00:11.857 --> 00:17.457
The wisdom you two display 
makes you fit to rule this world.

00:17.457 --> 00:19.837
You truly think so?

00:20.657 --> 00:21.957
But of course.

00:22.547 --> 00:25.267
There's no need to be
 so nervous, Töregene.

00:26.897 --> 00:29.647
I have something to discuss with you.

00:31.597 --> 00:34.617
<b>Winter, A.D. 1232</b>

00:43.737 --> 00:45.527
Good tidings, Great Kha'an.

00:45.857 --> 00:47.987
Tolui has crossed the Han River.

00:48.257 --> 00:50.947
The enemy troops 
are scurrying southward.

00:52.417 --> 00:54.577
You've done well, Tolui.

00:55.637 --> 01:00.097
All right. Let us also make our move
 and cross the river before us.

01:10.947 --> 01:13.637
<b>Jaadugar</b>

02:31.607 --> 02:33.757
So my brother has crossed
 the Yellow River?

02:33.757 --> 02:37.367
Yes. Reinforcements from the Great Kha'an
 are headed our way.

02:37.367 --> 02:38.767
We should convene forces.

02:38.767 --> 02:40.427
Convene, you say?

02:41.007 --> 02:42.187
Know a good location?

02:42.487 --> 02:44.667
Mount Sanfeng should serve us well.

